  "goodToKnow": "Mitgestalten means to help shape or have a say in: die Zukunft, die Gesellschaft, den Unterricht mitgestalten. It's a favourite of mission statements and civic participation projects. Gestalten means to shape or design, and die Gestaltung is design. In the workplace, German law gives employees Mitbestimmung (co-determination) through works councils. Separable: gestaltete mit, mitgestaltet."
